    "body": "This part has a problem that both script's type and \"parser-inserted\" are undefined if script has not been prepared, but \"implicitly render-blocking\" should always be defined.\r\n\r\nCan I say something like the element is not implicitly render-blocking if the script hasn't been prepared, and the value may be recomputed when it's prepared?",
